{"title":"Career Roadmap · Retail Space Designer","role":"Retail Space Designer","summary":"A Retail Space Designer plans and designs physical retail environments such as stores, showrooms, boutiques, malls, experience centres, pop-up stores, and brand spaces. The role combines interior/spatial design, customer experience, branding, visual merchandising, architecture basics, lighting, materials, and commercial strategy.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Exhibition / Retail / Spatial Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Retail Space Designer plans and designs physical retail environments such as stores, showrooms, boutiques, malls, experience centres, pop-up stores, and brand spaces. The role combines interior/spatial design, customer experience, branding, visual merchandising, architecture basics, lighting, materials, and commercial strategy."},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest profile combines creative spatial thinking","technical drawing","3D visualization","retail psychology","brand understanding","execution knowledge."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"B.Des – Exhibition / Retail / Spatial Design"}],[{"text":"Primary Career"},{"text":"Retail Space Designer"}],[{"text":"Core Work"},{"text":"Designing commercial retail environments"}],[{"text":"Spaces"},{"text":"Stores, showrooms, boutiques, malls, pop-ups, experience centres"}],[{"text":"Design Focus"},{"text":"Layout, circulation, display, lighting, materials, branding"}],[{"text":"Key Software"},{"text":"AutoCAD, SketchUp, Rhino, 3ds Max, Blender"}],[{"text":"Visualization"},{"text":"V-Ray, Enscape, Lumion, Twinmotion"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign"}],[{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Architects, contractors, brands, VM teams, vendors"}],[{"text":"Key Differentiator"},{"text":"Design that combines brand identity with customer experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Retail Space Designer Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Retail Space Designer transforms a brand's requirements into a physical customer environment."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Store layout"},{"text":"Customer circulation"},{"text":"Product display"},{"text":"Fixture design"},{"text":"Lighting concepts"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Signage"},{"text":"Brand integration"},{"text":"Window displays"},{"text":"Checkout areas"},{"text":"Trial rooms"},{"text":"Experience zones"},{"text":"Pop-up stores"},{"text":"Showrooms"},{"text":"Visual merchandising coordination"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply to make a store attractive."},{"type":"h","text":"It is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brand","Customer","Experience","Space","Product","Purchase"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Possible Role"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Retail Designer"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Retail Space Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Retail/Interior Designer"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Senior Retail Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Retail Design Lead"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Design Manager"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Retail Design Director"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Experience Design Director"}],[{"text":"Entrepreneurial"},{"text":"Retail Design Studio Founder"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Other pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual Merchandising Designer"},{"text":"Store Planning Designer"},{"text":"Brand Experience Designer"},{"text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"text":"Spatial Designer"},{"text":"Commercial Interior Designer"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Spatial & Design Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{